2	option	I just want to help them, I think they need help.
3	action	below
3	action	previous
2	option	Okay, thanks.
3	action	below
2	option	I'll give you some cash if you tell me.
2	line	Player	I'll give you some cash if you tell me.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	You think you can buy me?
2	line	Player	Err, no. I just want to compensate you for your trouble.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	You keep your money and I'll keep my secrets.
2	action	other
1	option	I just want to help them, I think they need help.
2	line	Player	I just want to help them, I think they need help.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Aye, everyone in these lands needs help. I'm sorry though, it's just not safe and it's not likely to get safer any time soon.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Look, I feel for them, I really do. They're fighting the good fight out there and unfortunately, some of them probably won't live through it.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Ivan in particular I feel sorry for. He's the youngest of their group and he's seen too few winters to be involved in such toil.
2	line	Player	Then tell me how to find them. I can help them.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	I support their cause. That doesn't mean I want to die for them though. I'm sorry, but I will not risk the wrath of the vampyres.
2	action	other
1	option	Okay, thanks.
2	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
2	action	end
