0	section	Talking to Cyreg after fixing the boaty
1	line	Player	Can I ask you some more questions?
1	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Sure you can.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Where am I meant to be going?
2	line	Player	Where am I meant to be going?
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Take my boat as far north as you can and you'll arrive at the Hollows. Keep heading north on foot, over the rotten bridge, and you'll eventually reach an odd looking tree. That is where you'll find the Myreque.
2	action	other
1	option	Tell me more about the Myreque.
2	line	Player	Tell me more about the Myreque.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	What do you want to know?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Why are they called the Myreque?
3	line	Player	Why are they called the Myreque?
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	It's a name the locals gave them. It means 'hidden in the myre'. Nothing fancy, it's just because that's where they hide, in Mort Myre.
3	action	other
2	option	Tell me about the members of the Myreque
3	line	Player	Tell me about the members of the Myreque.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Well you have Radigad Ponfit. He was a mercenary from Asgarnia but he joined up with the Myreque to settle some mysterious score with the Drakans.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Then there's Veliaf Hurtz, the leader of the group. He's been fighting the fight longer than any of them.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Next there's Ivan Strom. He's the youngest. I hear he's an aspiring priest. Not that there's much time for that around here.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	You've also got Sani Piliu, the only female of the group. She's a bit of a shady one. I reckon she was a thief before the Myreque found her.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	There's Harold Evans. Used to be part of some militia but was kicked out for being too hot-headed. Now he's the main fighter for the Myreque.
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	Finally, you have Polmafi Ferdygris. He's the brains of the operation in many ways. Believe it or not, he used to be a scholar.
3	line	Player	And that's all of them?
3	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	In Mort Myre it is. I sometimes hear rumour of more groups hidden in other parts of Morytania. Who knows if that's true though.
3	action	other
2	option	Let's talk about something else.
2	option	I'll be back later.
3	line	Player	I'll be back later.
3	action	end
2	option	Okay, thanks.
3	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
3	action	end
1	option	Tell me about the Drakans.
2	line	Player	Tell me about the Drakans.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	They're the family of vampyres that rules all of Morytania. Lowerniel Drakan is the head of the family. Every bit of misery in this place is caused by him.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	No one out here ever sees the Drakans, but their presence is always felt. Their castle towers over all of the region. A constant reminder of their tyranny.
2	action	other
1	option	Tell me about yourself.
2	line	Player	Tell me about yourself.
2	line	Cyreg Paddlehorn	I'm just a humble boatman. Cyreg Paddlehorn is my name. Like most of the Paddlehorns before me, I make my living by tacking the swamps of Mort Myre.
2	action	other
1	option	I'll be back later.
2	line	Player	I'll be back later.
2	action	end
1	option	Okay, thanks.
2	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
2	action	end
